**Test:** `testPreventsDuplicateReadReceipts`
**Status:** ✅ RESOLVED

### Issue 3: Presence Multi-Device
**Problem:** User marked offline when one device disconnected
**Solution:** Track multiple metas per user in Phoenix.Presence
